#: scenario5:scenario5_4BDEEDC1_33F0_4AA8_BF5D_2A2E636A7437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 152ac44c562bf4658665f858409c62f616c3e23fd68f58aff645c476c92b53a9
