msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The light shining in through the windows is swallowed whole by the darkness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫原本在那时照入的一丝微光——⟪k:2⟫再一次被眼前的黑暗所吞没，⟪k:3⟫完全消失不见。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A429384_63EF_448F_BB1E_187BA0AE1A0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46d87f206bccd2bb25d7eada15d8373281d10bb7e36a14f2f254bccd7b4b1f85
#. default-sha256: 81c8c26b7571d81338e664b56dbe7da006593e68d38195ba09653319a73e8170
