msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We saw it, though...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Together, we watched the light crack open the "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫尽管如此……⟪k:3⟫你也的确看到了……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫是你和我一同……⟪k:6⟫让那片黑暗重见天日……"

