"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Who would ⟪k:3⟫ever⟪k:4⟫ be concerned about ⟪k:5⟫you⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I just want to "
"be able to sleep well at night.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫And I’m not interested in throwing more servants to the "
"lions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫谁说我担心了。⟪k:3⟫只是让你一个人去那种地方的话，我会做恶梦的，还是饶了我吧。⟪k:4⟫"
"我不过是觉得要是现在佣人无端减少的话，会很麻烦而已。"

