"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫My relationship with Michel "
"gradually transitioned from master and servant to something closer to friends."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫米歇尔和我的关系，⟪k:13⟫渐渐地"
"变得像朋友一样。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C80E822B_FA8A_4411_821A_E295F40BFF1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09f63406d725688437c5733cc5d08cbf05324b51bac1abb821104d7ecfa485be
