msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was still my master, but he allowed me almost complete freedom,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使我和他还是主仆的关系，⟪k:1⟫他也允许我自由地行动——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1DC9B6EA_6289_4FA4_8355_19D0E652CBBE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a192d3272b54850b6c56d9dc11962107eba853006f5b7a61537f5e3f8877055
