msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1DC9B6EA_6289_4FA4_8355_19D0E652CBBE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and he didn’t order me around either.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He even gave me a hand with my work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫虽然他本该是主人，⟪k:1⟫但从没有命令过我什么。⟪k:2⟫反而，⟪k:3⟫在各种方面都尽力帮助着我。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A87FD8DF_8DC5_4511_92C2_070132823A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 899b0c1626033348514f7672836502e7212cd7a158ce14ac15cbfb484c67f803
#. default-sha256: a2df5eb47702f356918c398d9d9da09ebf29abfc77f77d003687212f2d618657
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A87FD8DF_8DC5_4511_92C2_070132823A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though he was still not very talkative and oftentimes hard to read,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫尽管他还是一如既往的沉默寡言，⟪k:1⟫很难读懂他在想什么，⟪k:2⟫但我却有一种——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2741137E_28E2_442A_BC1B_98B1B92244DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdb6934fcf24fe22ef63823413c240e39c369c82d6ac12c0c6502feef766ac34
