msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2741137E_28E2_442A_BC1B_98B1B92244DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫he at least seemed to be making an effort to close the gap."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「他渐渐愿意靠近我了」一样的感觉。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7daa80860ff9bfe226f817c5596d627d6e6c704f386d92c2f6a3ced17ec18ac
#. default-sha256: aeeeba1a67580bdbbc653f3338c8fa1542d08686dd7973f471eabe119fd4cea3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would, on occasion, tell me about himself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not in much detail, and "
"anytime his family came up, he grimaced uncomfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他很少说话，⟪k:1⟫但还是把自己的身世告诉了我。⟪k:2⟫每触及到他家人的话题时，⟪k:3⟫他的表情总会有"
"些不自然。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77bfa86178688faea4d6ebd4990c1c92fbd3738912a7414a84604a63d0427ec3
#. default-sha256: f0107e7127e3fc32bce41c2b6ae744d90d40aad4d99108d427ab3c8b399ce82a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, his father had wanted him dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫听起来，⟪k:1⟫他的父亲好像希望他死去。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcc259a3c8937f07fc03e8af2302b2454a984d89ab059689f680bb930834ae5a
#. default-sha256: 1d42402e53d58210c7fadba5139207be91acfbc3c00cba1d664427c808540b0f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His brothers, though, had worked to create a scenario in which he could live, faking his "
"death and sending him to this remote mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫而他的哥哥们则一面伪造出米歇尔已死的假象，⟪k:1⟫一面为他留了条活路。⟪k:2⟫也因此，⟪k:3⟫他才被流"
"放到了这种偏僻之地。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8799dce3d9da5d38d6cb574dbbee65475b17bdd260941dd218ed06b308730e97
#. default-sha256: 76cc4589d4d45562350577ad149814c35c8e7a1c6fbda14f2a67922c5eab5cb4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never encountered Michel’s brothers while at his family’s estate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……我暂留在博林杰家时，⟪k:1⟫从没见过米歇尔的哥哥。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca206d0e5ba4bf1603d1466e1e08c5523d2d7b83262585694c40975f0fc60f2f
#. default-sha256: aad6b46bad8bd212210e78efd5a4cbb4ec8fd9ecd502f71d19362641446eca6b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But assuming he was right and it was one of them who had given me that letter, they were "
"likely our only allies at that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫如果马车上的信是他哥哥留给我的话，⟪k:2⟫那么在那个家里，⟪k:3⟫一定只有他们是站在米歇"
"尔这边的吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eb0822aa59814dd48ca65d627477b77ffbed6fa69ab5e55adddca8f6e4205ef
#. default-sha256: d55712a1669513df9a96ef6cd1c2e501b5ab028d6f287ca9be7391303aa0a498
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t know what he’s thinking. It’s been ten years,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Michel had muttered, ⟪k:3⟫"
"to which I had replied, ⟪k:4⟫“Have faith.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然已被流放了十年的米歇尔口口声声说「已经不明白哥哥们在想什么了」，⟪k:1⟫但——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2584C624_1FCF_439F_9EB2_11669D77B571
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70c416f2a86ddd68c29d38f4dbb2818e6a4adc68d1bbb020500cfae726cba1eb
#. default-sha256: 5952029ea298588aff08eaedf08b9a1a3431a159fae1e5c661ff48d63d8fbba1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2584C624_1FCF_439F_9EB2_11669D77B571"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫我还是跟他说，⟪k:1⟫要相信自己的哥哥。"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我还是跟他说，⟪k:1⟫要相信自己的哥哥。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a82cf450ed6ab9eefd2d2d325c94fa96356201767dfc17020f7530f9def6eee
#. default-sha256: eafa98e3b8ee4dc4d665d4ca663d321f5df42e8dff5a2c3f5c99b4bcfcb35ac4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was better to believe in ⟪k:1⟫something⟪k:2⟫,⟪k:3⟫even if it felt silly and unreasonable,"
"⟪k:4⟫than to lose faith in everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫就算盲信会让人显得愚笨也好，⟪k:1⟫就算被说成自以为是也罢。⟪k:2⟫但我觉得，与其选择什么都不相"
"信，⟪k:3⟫还是选择相信比较好。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bac3c4babb1993714bb20b92dd264b95a2ea816a03856748739fcf6e7c3cc92
#. default-sha256: 63d2ebc879e5e10fcc47dcbe0fcae3cb19c6403a4a3ce3d46f9b51d1e4421191
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My being able to find renewed belief in the kindness of people...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫was what had "
"allowed me to start smiling again, after all."
