#: scenario5:scenario5_5CFDE739_5F9A_4964_A86B_4BF96423A8EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 178c34acdfbcbebfc666133b51aaf17e8667dfeab940056f0bc1a67829694455
