msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Are you sure about that?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You turned down my proposal, saying I was “wasting my "
"time.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫有啊，⟪k:1⟫你不记得了吗？⟪k:2⟫那时，⟪k:3⟫老爷对我的提议是这么说回答的——「净说些无聊事」。"

